[I] An open-source MIDI sequencer/filter

[T] Midish is an open-source MIDI sequencer/filter for Unix-like operating
[T] systems. Implemented as a simple command-line interpreter (like a shell)
[T] it's intended to be lightweight, fast and reliable for real-time
[T] performance.

[U] https://www.midish.org/

[A] Alexandre Ratchov <alex@caoua.org>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

